{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52282","headline":"诗（幷序） 四十三 · 王梵志","name":"诗（幷序） 四十三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"好住四合舍，殷勤堂上妻。\n无常煞鬼至，火急被追[催]（摧）。\n露头赤脚走，不容得着鞋。\n向前任料理，难见却回来。\n有意造一佛，爲设百人斋。\n无情任改嫁，资产听将陪。\n吾在惜不用，死後他人财。\n忆[想]（相）生平日，悔不唱《三台》。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52282.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52282","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}